Write a sb program that implements a linear programming solver using the revised simplex method.
 
Solve this problem:
A nutritionist wants to minimize the cost of a daily supplement mix using two brands, 
  Brand A (x) and Brand B (y)
  while meeting minimum dietary requirements.

Objective Function: 
  Minimize Cost = 5x + 7y

Constraints: 
  Vitamin A: 2x + 1y >= 8
  Vitamin C: 1x + 2y >= 10
  Non negativity: x => 0
  Non negativity: y >= 0

  